    <!-- Aquaculture Grants Section  -->
    <div class="page-content mb-70">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="row">
          <div class="col-md-12">
            <div class="custom-heading02">
              <h2>
                Aquaculture grants and refrigerated vans for seafood transport
              </h2>
              <p>
                Mechanical refrigeration and insulated van builds that support
                aquaculture cold chain logistics
              </p>
            </div>
            <!-- .custom-heading02 end -->
          </div>
          <!-- .col-md-12 end -->
        </div>

        <div class="row mb-30">
          <div class="col-md-12">
            <p>
              Aquaculture businesses require reliable temperature-controlled
              transport to protect product quality, meet food safety
              requirements, and reduce spoilage during distribution. Proper
              refrigerated vans and trucks help maintain target temperatures,
              extend shelf life, and preserve the value of seafood and shellfish
              through the distribution chain.
            </p>

            <p>
              The Farm &amp; Food Growth Fund Aquaculture Grant Program (<a
                href="https://www.ffgrowthfund.org/aquaculture-grants"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                >Farm &amp; Food Growth Fund aquaculture grants page</a
              >) identifies mechanical refrigeration equipment used to retrofit
              owned vehicles for distribution of aquaculture products as an
              eligible expense. Mechanical refrigeration equipment can include
              the refrigeration unit and the required vehicle integration to
              maintain a continuous cold chain.
            </p>

            <p>
              Cool Fox Trucks is a custom refrigerated van builder that works
              with aquaculture and seafood operators pursuing grant-funded
              infrastructure upgrades. We design and install refrigeration and
              insulation packages for refrigerated vans and trucks to meet
              specific temperature targets and operational workflows. We do not
              administer, approve, or guarantee grants; we provide vehicle
              solutions that align with program eligibility for refrigeration.
            </p>

            <ul class="fa-ul">
              <li>
                <i class="fa fa-li fa-long-arrow-right"></i> Seafood and
                shellfish transportation
              </li>
              <li>
                <i class="fa fa-li fa-long-arrow-right"></i> Aquaculture farms
                and hatcheries
              </li>
              <li>
                <i class="fa fa-li fa-long-arrow-right"></i> Cold-chain and
                last-mile refrigerated delivery
              </li>
              <li>
                <i class="fa fa-li fa-long-arrow-right"></i> Grant-funded
                infrastructure upgrades
              </li>
            </ul>

            <p>
              Learn more about program scope and eligible expenses on the
              <a
                href="https://www.ffgrowthfund.org/aquaculture-grants"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                >Farm &amp; Food Growth Fund aquaculture grants page</a
              >.
            </p>

            <div class="mt-48">
              <a href="contact.html"
                ><div class="button radius">
                  Request a grant-ready refrigerated van
                </div></a
              >
            </div>
          </div>
          <!-- .col-md-12 end -->
        </div>
        <!-- .row.mb-30 end -->
      </div>
      <!-- .container end -->
    </div>
    <!-- End Aquaculture Grants Section  -->
